
=== Riepilogo configurazione ===

✅ Controllo topologia: LAN e subnet coerenti.
✅ Controlli: nessuna dimenticanza trovata.

r1   [ospf]
  OSPF: 20.20.0.0/16 area 0.0.0.0   redistribute connected   auto-cost 100

r2   [ospf]
  OSPF: 20.20.0.0/16 area 0.0.0.0   redistribute connected   auto-cost 100
  costo OSPF: eth0 100

r3 (AS20)   [bgp ospf]
  OSPF: 20.20.0.0/16 area 0.0.0.0   redistribute connected, bgp   auto-cost 100
  network BGP: 10.1.0.0/30, 20.20.0.0/16
  10.1.0.2        r5         AS30    eBGP  nessuna policy

r4   [ospf]
  OSPF: 20.20.0.0/16 area 0.0.0.0   redistribute connected   auto-cost 100

r5 (AS30)   [bgp rip]
  RIP: 30.30.0.0/16   redistribute connected, bgp
  network BGP: 10.1.0.0/30, 30.30.0.0/16
  10.1.0.1        r3         AS20    eBGP  nessuna policy

r6   [rip]
  RIP: 30.30.0.0/16   redistribute connected

r7   [rip]
  RIP: 30.30.0.0/16   redistribute connected

--- Host e server ---
client  host  20.20.1.2/24 (LAN A)   gw 20.20.1.1 (r1)
server  www   30.30.1.2/24 (LAN L)   gw 30.30.1.1 (r6)   apache2 avviato

Controlla ogni frase del testo: filtri (deny), preferenze (local-preference), MED (metric), network annunciate, costi OSPF, gateway e resolver dei pc, deleghe DNS.

